# status：modified、deleted、untracked 三类判定
> init
<<<
+ wug.txt wug.txt
> add wug.txt
<<<
+ other.txt notwug.txt
> add other.txt
<<<
> commit "base"
<<<

# wug.txt 改（modified）；other.txt 从工作目录删掉（deleted）；新建 untracked
+ wug.txt notwug.txt
- other.txt
+ untracked.txt wug.txt
> status
=== Branches ===
*master

=== Staged Files ===

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===
other.txt (deleted)
wug.txt (modified)

=== Untracked Files ===
untracked.txt

<<<
